Comment: 0,0:01:01.49,0:01:04.11,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,此刻胸中的我更觉昂扬
Comment: 0,0:01:04.11,0:01:06.42,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,言语难以传达啊愚顽之徒
Comment: 0,0:01:06.52,0:01:09.02,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,擂台钟岂容久候
Comment: 0,0:01:09.02,0:01:11.49,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,我挚爱的沙袋
Comment: 0,0:01:11.49,0:01:15.81,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,绝不手下留情
Comment: 0,0:01:15.81,0:01:18.42,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,此血奔涌于身躯之间
Comment: 0,0:01:18.42,0:01:20.79,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,沸腾而燃
Comment: 0,0:01:20.79,0:01:23.12,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,不为他人言语所役
Comment: 0,0:01:23.12,0:01:25.87,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,而自立生存
Comment: 0,0:01:25.87,0:01:28.29,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,我不曾有败北之念
Comment: 0,0:01:28.29,0:01:30.61,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,直至此身朽灭
Comment: 0,0:01:30.71,0:01:33.21,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,亦曾立誓奉献
Comment: 0,0:01:33.21,0:01:35.61,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,只为那不属于任何人的你
Comment: 0,0:01:35.71,0:01:38.30,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,于战场之上芳华飞舞
Comment: 0,0:01:38.40,0:01:40.59,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,美艳傲放
Comment: 0,0:01:40.59,0:01:43.04,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,从不需他人援手
Comment: 0,0:01:43.04,0:01:45.57,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,直至与你相遇
Comment: 0,0:01:45.57,0:01:48.09,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,我不曾有败北之念
Comment: 0,0:01:48.09,0:01:50.51,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,直至此身朽灭
Comment: 0,0:01:50.51,0:01:52.99,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,亦曾立誓奉献
Comment: 0,0:01:52.99,0:01:55.49,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,只为那不属于任何人的你
Comment: 0,0:01:55.49,0:01:58.02,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,如初吻般
Comment: 0,0:01:58.02,0:02:01.09,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,不灭的这份我亦将永恒
Comment: 1,0:00:30.09,0:00:30.09,OPCN,,0,0,0,,
